       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RNDMODES.
      * ROUNDED MODE (cob_decimal_do_round) for each round_choice, on
      * positive, negative and tie values, with ON SIZE ERROR.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 VALS.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE +1.250.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE +1.350.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE +1.251.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE -1.250.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE -1.350.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE -1.249.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE +1.200.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE +0.050.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE -0.001.
          05 FILLER PIC S9V999 VALUE +2.450.
       01 VAL-TAB REDEFINES VALS.
          05 V PIC S9V999 OCCURS 10.
       01 I   PIC 99.
       01 R   PIC -9.9.
       01 S   PIC S9V9.
       01 P   PIC S9(3)P.
       01 BIG PIC S9(3)V9(2).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 10
               DISPLAY V (I) " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE AWAY-FROM-ZERO = V (I)
               MOVE S TO R DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE NEAREST-AWAY-FROM-ZERO = V (I)
               MOVE S TO R DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE IS NEAREST-EVEN = V (I)
               MOVE S TO R DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE NEAREST-TOWARD-ZERO = V (I)
               MOVE S TO R DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE TOWARD-GREATER = V (I)
               MOVE S TO R DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE TOWARD-LESSER = V (I)
               MOVE S TO R DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE TRUNCATION = V (I)
               MOVE S TO R DISPLAY R " " WITH NO ADVANCING
               MOVE 9 TO S
               COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE PROHIBITED = V (I)
               MOVE S TO R DISPLAY R
           END-PERFORM
           COMPUTE BIG = 1.234
           COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE PROHIBITED = BIG
               ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "PROHIBITED SIZE " S
               NOT ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "PROHIBITED OK " S
           END-COMPUTE
           COMPUTE S ROUNDED MODE PROHIBITED = 1.2
               ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "PROHIBITED SIZE " S
               NOT ON SIZE ERROR DISPLAY "PROHIBITED OK " S
           END-COMPUTE
           COMPUTE P ROUNDED MODE NEAREST-EVEN = 12345
           DISPLAY P
           COMPUTE P ROUNDED MODE TOWARD-GREATER = 12341
           DISPLAY P
           ADD 0.05 TO BIG GIVING S ROUNDED MODE TOWARD-LESSER
           DISPLAY S
           MULTIPLY 1.01 BY BIG ROUNDED MODE AWAY-FROM-ZERO
           DISPLAY BIG
           DIVIDE 3 INTO BIG ROUNDED MODE NEAREST-EVEN
           DISPLAY BIG
           STOP RUN.
